{
    "background_story": "Monica was a brilliant engineer with a passion for renewable energy. Growing up, she was fascinated by the works of James Watt, the inventor of the steam engine. She spent countless hours studying his designs and experimenting with new ways to harness power. After completing her Ph.D., Monica founded a company that specialized in developing innovative solar panels. Her team's breakthrough design, which increased energy efficiency by 20%, revolutionized the industry. The Monica Watt Solar Panel, as it came to be known, was named in honor of her inspiration. Today, Monica's company is a leading provider of sustainable energy solutions, powering homes and businesses around the world. Her dedication to Watt's legacy has made a lasting impact on the environment and the lives of millions.",
